e":"抖音全域电商数据在哪里统一查看?蝉妈妈数据分析平台完整攻略 - 蝉妈妈运营圈","url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/1780.html","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/article/1780.html","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":17,"title":"抖店开放平台","url":"https://op.jinritemai.com/docs/guide-docs/83/7356","normalized_url":"https://op.jinritemai.com/docs/guide-docs/83/7356","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":18,"title":"抖店开放平台","url":"https://op.jinritemai.com/docs/guide-docs/83/7356?from=list&docLabel=","normalized_url":"https://op.jinritemai.com/docs/guide-docs/83/7356?from=list&docLabel=","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":19,"title":"百家好Basic House女装旗舰店-红人详情-抖音-热浪数据","url":"https://www.relangdata.cn/douyin/person_detail_2010349906438500.html","normalized_url":"https://www.relangdata.cn/douyin/person_detail_2010349906438500.html","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":20,"title":"抖音奢侈品类目店铺投放排行榜_2026年04月05日日榜 - 蝉妈妈·创意","url":"https://cy.chanmama.com/open/shopRank/12/day/2026-04-05.html","normalized_url":"https://cy.chanmama.com/open/shopRank/12/day/2026-04-05.html","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":21,"title":"要求赔偿因无法退货导致银行红包失效的经济损失_黑猫投诉","url":"https://tousu.sina.cn/complaint/view/17377750128?sld=7e462de4917233e858e640e3586fd8f4","normalized_url":"https://tousu.sina.cn/complaint/view/17377750128?sld=7e462de4917233e858e640e3586fd8f4","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":22,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":23,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":24,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":25,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":26,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":27,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true}],"substantive":true,"replacement":false,"judgment":null},{"date":"2026-10-15","repeat_index":2,"answer_text":"# Basic House百家好抖音销量查看（分3种身份）\n> 重要：**普通消费者看不到品牌全店总销量，只能看单品页面展示的【已售】**；完整品牌全店数据只有商家后台或第三方数据工具能查\n\n## 一、普通用户（抖音APP，免费，只能看单品）\n1. 抖音搜索：**Basic House百家好**，进入品牌官方抖音店铺主页\n2. 点开任意商品，商品详情页可以看到 **已售XX件**（平台对外展示的单品累计销量，有脱敏，不是完整后台成交订单）\n3. 缺点：**没有品牌全店汇总销量**，只能逐个商品看单品已售，不含达人分销的全部渠道汇总。\n\n## 二、如果你是百家好店铺商家（官方真实完整数据｜抖音电商罗盘）\nPC端：登录**抖店后台 → 顶部【电商罗盘】**\n- 看全店总销量：罗盘→交易→全店成交分析，选择时间（7天/30天），查看成交订单数\n- 看各个单品销量：罗盘→商品→商品列表，可筛选品牌所有单品成交\n手机端：抖店APP → 首页【数据】→【数据罗盘】\n\n> 罗盘是抖音官方唯一真实后台数据，包含自营+达人带货、直播+短视频+商城货架全部成交，可拆分渠道、看退款、趋势。\n\n## 三、竞品/第三方调研（看百家好全网估算销量，付费工具，数据为估算值，非官方精确数）\n蝉妈妈、飞瓜数据、新抖这类第三方抖音电商数据分析平台：\n1. 搜索品牌名：Basic House / 百家好\n2. 进入品牌详情页，查看品牌在抖音全平台（自营店+达人带货）估算销量、销售额、爆品榜单\n⚠️ 注意：第三方数据是**估算脱敏数据，和抖店后台真实成交会存在误差，仅做参考，不能当作官方准确销量**\n\n## 补充说明\n1. 抖音不会对外公开品牌**全店累计总销量**，官方只对该品牌商家自己开放完整汇总数据\n2. 商品详情页的“已售”会有统计口径限制，不等于后台成交订单（剔除退款规则不一样）\n3. 百家好在抖音可能存在多个店铺/多账号达人带货，统计品牌全域销量要把多店铺、达人分销全部合并统计，普通用户无法直接拿到。\n","source_capture_status":"captured","source_cards":[{"ordinal":1,"title":"抖音电商罗盘最全最新介绍手册(经营版)","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHrV1Z179ify?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=11183dc2-ee62-45da-b035-c71ed0e692b9","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHrV1Z179ify?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=11183dc2-ee62-45da-b035-c71ed0e692b9","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":2,"title":"抖音电商罗盘-抖店商家、达人和机构多视角数据平台","url":"https://compass.jinritemai.com/shop","normalized_url":"https://compass.jinritemai.com/shop","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":3,"title":"抖音电商-学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHSLjJ4EXZ57/cHSLjJ4EXZ57lHSLwWrdnmCx?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=map","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHSLjJ4EXZ57/cHSLjJ4EXZ57lHSLwWrdnmCx?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=map","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":4,"title":"不做直播短视频也有销量，获取商城免费流量!-抖音电商学习中心，抖店官方教你运营抖音小店","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHcSAD2pABUf?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm