78","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7680036067147945378","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":17,"title":"飞瓜数据-助力电商销量、营销声量双丰收-feigua.cn","url":"https://www.feigua.cn/","normalized_url":"https://www.feigua.cn/","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":18,"title":"抖音电商罗盘最新最全介绍手册(达人版)-抖音电商学习中心，抖店官方教你运营抖音小店","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/113166?btm_ppre=a4977.b5856.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=140da441-3f9b-4ace-b852-84e3badf920e","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/113166?btm_ppre=a4977.b5856.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=140da441-3f9b-4ace-b852-84e3badf920e","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":19,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":20,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":21,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":22,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":23,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true},{"ordinal":24,"title":null,"url":null,"normalized_url":"","is_empty":true}],"substantive":true,"replacement":false,"judgment":null},{"date":"2026-10-15","repeat_index":3,"answer_text":"# ✅ 分两种情况：你是百家好商家 / 外部第三方查百家好销量\n## 一、如果你是Basic House百家好品牌/店铺商家（官方完整数据）\n用**抖音电商罗盘**（抖店官方后台，最权威）\n1. PC端：登录抖店后台 → 顶部【电商罗盘】\n    - 看**全店总销量**：罗盘 → 交易 → 全店成交分析，可筛选时间（日/7天/30天），看成交订单、GMV、退款数据\n    - 看单品销量：罗盘 → 商品 → 商品概览/单品分析，找到Basic House各个单品销量、直播/短视频/商城渠道拆分数据\n2. 手机端（抖店APP）：首页 → 数据 → 数据罗盘，同样可以看店铺、商品成交数据\n\n> 如果是品牌多店（百家好多个抖音店铺），用**罗盘·策略版**，绑定旗下全部店铺，查看品牌全域汇总销量\n\n## 二、如果你是第三方（非百家好店铺，只能看公开估算数据）\n> ⚠️ **抖音不会对外公开品牌全店真实总销量**，你只能看商品页面展示的「已售」（公开的单品累计销量），或者第三方工具估算值（存在误差）\n1. 抖音APP前台（免费，仅单品）\n    抖音搜索：Basic House百家好官方旗舰店，进入店铺，点开商品，商品页会显示**已售XX件**（单品累计销量，不是全品牌总销量）\n2. 第三方数据工具（蝉妈妈、新抖、灰豚等，付费为主，估算数据）\n    在工具里搜店铺名称【Basic House百家好】，查看店铺预估GMV、预估销量、爆品榜单；\n    ✘ 注意：属于估算值，和抖店罗盘真实数据有偏差，只能做参考，不能当作准确财报数据。\n\n## 补充说明\n- 抖音前台商品“已售”：**只展示单品对外公开销量**，不会汇总整个品牌多个店铺、多个达人分销的全部销量；\n- 罗盘后台数据：**只有该店铺的抖店账号登录才能查看**，外人无法直接进入查看百家好后台真实全店销量。\n\n\n你是想查百家好**单品前台销量**，还是**全店/品牌整体预估销量**？","source_capture_status":"captured","source_cards":[{"ordinal":1,"title":"抖音电商罗盘最全最新介绍手册(经营版)","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHrV1Z179ify?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=11183dc2-ee62-45da-b035-c71ed0e692b9","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHrV1Z179ify?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=11183dc2-ee62-45da-b035-c71ed0e692b9","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":2,"title":"抖音电商罗盘-抖店商家、达人和机构多视角数据平台","url":"https://compass.jinritemai.com/shop","normalized_url":"https://compass.jinritemai.com/shop","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":3,"title":"抖音电商-学习中心","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHSLjJ4EXZ57/cHSLjJ4EXZ57lHSLwWrdnmCx?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=map","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cHSLjJ4EXZ57/cHSLjJ4EXZ57lHSLwWrdnmCx?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=map","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":4,"title":"不做直播短视频也有销量，获取商城免费流量!-抖音电商学习中心，抖店官方教你运营抖音小店","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHcSAD2pABUf?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=7e6df7ca-f043-46ad-8607-0e4aa973b21e","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHcSAD2pABUf?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=7e6df7ca-f043-46ad-8607-0e4aa973b21e","is_empty":false},{"ordinal":5,"title":"商品概览& 详情-如何分析商品不同渠道成交数据和单品直播高光片段?-抖音电商学习中心，抖店官方教你运营抖音小店","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHJAanDCCT8b?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=0fce23c7-ba10-4e8d-ba13-29448cd6e11f","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHJAanDCCT8b?btm_ppre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_pre=a4977.b7658.c0.d0&btm_show_id=0fce23c7-ba10-4e8d-ba13-29448cd6e1